    <DataNode elementId="AT5G07990-MONOMER" textLabel="flavonoid 3&apos;-monooxygenase" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT5G07990.1" dataSource="TAIR gene name" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="415" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">TargetP location: * The gene encoding the flavonoid 3&apos;-hydroxylase in &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt; was isolated and its molecular function verfied by recombinant expression in yeast. The enzyme converted both naringenin and dihydrokaempferol into the corresponding 3&apos;,4&apos;-hydroxylated products, i.e. eriodictyol and dihydroquercetin respectively. The enzyme has been characterized as a cytochrome P450-dependent monooxygenase and was highly expressed in senescing leaves, flowers and siliques |CITS: [11030432]|</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT5G07990-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT5G07990.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pid" value="AAG16744" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="TT7" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="AT5g07990" />
      <Property key="Synonym_3" value="CYP75B1" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-12634, RXN-T9-755, RXN-1F-73, RXN-6819" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="4" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT5G07990.1" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT5G07990" />
